Attribution: cite the paper and the Zenodo record listed in CITATION.cff.

Two exceptions apply. Bibliographic records harvested from OpenAlex keep OpenAlex's CC0 dedication. Benchmark items,
prompts and model replies that belong to the re-executed papers keep the licence of their source; the request-response
